                  modes.

     110000bbaasseeTTXX    Set 100Mbps (Fast Ethernet) operation.  The ifconfig(8)
                  mmeeddiiaaoopptt option can also be used to select either
                  ffuullll--dduupplleexx or hhaallff--dduupplleexx modes.

     11000000bbaasseeSSXX   Sets 1000Mbps operation.  Only ffuullll--dduupplleexx mode is supported
                  at this speed.

     11000000bbaasseeTT    Set 1000baseT operation over twisted pair.  Only ffuullll--dduupplleexx
                  mode is supported.

     22550000BBaasseeSSXX   Set 2500Mbps operation.  Only ffuullll--dduupplleexx mode is supported.

     The bbccee driver supports the following media options:

     ffuullll--dduupplleexx  Force full duplex operation.

     hhaallff--dduupplleexx  Force half duplex operation.

     For more information on configuring this device, see ifconfig(8).

